<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32508" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκνεφ-ίας</span></b>  (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνεμος</span>), ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a hurricane, caused by clouds meeting and
				bursting,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				46.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				365a
			</span></i>&lt;*&gt; ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νότος ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					20.88
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ὄμβρος</span> rain <i>with sunshine,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.96
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ἥλιος</span>”
				<i>seen through clouds,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Herod.Med.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				10.9.1
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>Gym.</u>
				58
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. πυρετός,</span> perh. fever with
			sweating, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i> ap. Gal.l.c.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
